    <h2>
      A Bilateral Cognitive Architecture for Advanced Robotics
    </h2>

    <p>
      Developed by Dr. Alexander Durig, Dual Brain Robotics explores a
      new approach to artificial intelligence and robotics inspired by
      the cooperative structure of the human brain.
    </p>

